1. Commas as field separators
2. LF and CRLF record endings (so handle \r\n)
3. Quoted fields containing commas/newlines
4. Escaped double quotes represented as two double quotes ("")
5. Empty fields
6. A final record without a newline
7. No trailing record separator adding an extra empty row
8. Empty input returns []
9. Reject unclosed quoted field with SyntaxError
10. Preserve spaces within fields

